+## Refusals
+
+| Command | Rule |
+| --- | --- |
+| `kill`, `pkill`, `claude stop` | Never. Stop a background command with `TaskStop`. |
+| `git commit --no-verify` | Never. Fix what the hook reports. |
+| An edit to a setting, a hook registration, a permission rule, or an auto-mode entry, or `stow` | Outside this pass. Needing one is a stop. |
+| A skill or doc file edited from Bash (a heredoc, `sed -i`, a Python one-liner) | Never. Use the Edit tool. |
+| `claude-tooling-sync apply`, `claude-tooling-sync update-skills`, `gh release create`, any command in the Survey repo | Never. The Survey follow-up is a backlog item and Geoff's call. |
+| A compound command auto mode refuses | Run its parts as single commands, with no `cd` and no pipe. |
+| A command refused with "Classifier unavailable" | Run it once more, unchanged. |
+| A push | Only `git push -u origin ur-w5`. Never to `main`, never forced. |
+| A merge, or any `approval-queue` command | Never. The conductor's. |
+| `gh pr view --json statusCheckRollup`, or a `gh pr view` chained to another `gh pr` command | The repo has no PR checks to read (`dotfiles-pass`, "CI watch: None"). Read a PR with `gh pr view <n> --json state,isDraft,baseRefName,body`, run alone. |
+| A read of a transcript under `~/.claude/projects` | Never. |
+| `cairn-run-gate '<string>'` | Use `bash scripts/gate.sh`. |
+| `notify-send` | Never. |
