+One `standards:plan-reviewer` read ran on 2026-11-12 (Opus 5.5 at `medium`). Verdict `fix`, no
+blocker. The reviewer reran every wording check's before-command, searches 1 to 10, and rows M3
+to M8 and M10, and confirmed `Q` lines 34, 40, 54, 104, and 114. Each finding and its fold:
